flowchart LR
  A([Request submitted]) --> B[Validate fields]
  B --> C{Valid?}
  C -- No --> D[Acknowledge invalid request] --> Z1([Invalid])
  C -- Yes --> E[Load active approver configuration]
  E --> F{Configuration valid?}
  F -- No --> G[Preserve request and alert owner] --> Z2([Configuration error])
  F -- Yes --> H[Generate idempotent request ID]
  H --> I[Create immutable SharePoint submission]
  I --> J[Create Teams approval<br/>email disabled]
  J --> K{Assigned approver decision}
  K -- Approve/Reject --> N[Persist first final outcome<br/>and audit fields]
  K -- Cancelled by requester --> N
  K -- 14-day timeout --> L[Create EDMS escalation<br/>email disabled] --> M[EDMS decision] --> N
  N --> O[Surface to owner, requester,<br/>assigned approver only] --> Z3([Finalized])
